'''Quinault''' ({{lang|qun|Kʷínaył}}) is a member of the [[Tsamosan languages|Tsamosan (Olympic)]] branch of the [[Coast Salish languages|Coast Salish]] family of [[Salishan languages]]. It is extinct, but efforts are being taken to revitalize it.

